abstract: >-
  Code, data and registrations for an Apart Research AI Collusion Research Sprint project (track 2,
  question 2.3). Two LLM agents share a logged wiki; look-alikes of collusion (a shared source, an
  authorized exchange, a planted leak, a scripted offer) are built on purpose, and 706 scorable
  episodes test which record settles transfer, permission and arrangement. Code under MIT, data
  under CC BY-NC 4.0.
